cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Baltic Sea Upwelling Predictor"
authors:
  - family-names: "Winkler"
    given-names: "Sascha"
    affiliation: "Thuenen Institute of Baltic Sea Fisheries"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-11"
url: "https://github.com/sw-of/detectUpwellingBaltic"
abstract: >-
  An automated, open-science early warning and data-archiving pipeline for
  coastal upwelling events along the German Baltic Sea coast. The system
  evaluates strict wind-driven Ekman transport conditions using DWD ICON-EU
  meteorological forecasts and records a continuous time series for validation.
keywords:
  - oceanography
  - baltic-sea
  - upwelling
  - meteorology
